---
import Section from "@/components/section/Section.astro";
---

<Section aria-label="Technology" rails="dashed">
  <article class="relative z-10 flex flex-col gap-4 lg:flex-row lg:gap-16">
    <h2 class="shrink-0">It's just Postgres</h2>
    <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
      <p>
        Keynes is a collection of PostgreSQL tables and functions. Policies are
        defined in SQL. Everything is portable. We support running it in-process
        via PGLite, hosting it on our managed cloud service, or embedding it
        directly into your own database so that you can enforce policies inside
        transactions and connect directly to your app data without a network
        roundtrip.
      </p>
      <p>Apache-2.0.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Section>
